/**
 * Render-time localization for product COLOR (pa_color) and MATERIAL
 * (product_material) attribute names. Same approach as
 * lib/i18n/category-translations.ts: WordPress stores these in English only, so
 * we map the stable taxonomy SLUG -> a localized label on the Next.js side and
 * fall back to the (entity-decoded) English name for anything unmapped.
 *
 * Covers every storefront locale (de/fr/es/ja/zh/zh-hant). zh (Simplified) is
 * derived from zh-hant via OpenCC tw->cn — edit zh-hant and regenerate, don't
 * hand-edit zh. (Generated by scripts/_gen-attr-i18n.ts.)
 */
